399	$A \otimes A^* \to I$. The unitality of $\varepsilon$ determines fidelity: non-unital $\varepsilon$ means information
400	loss (\text{{\igfont 𐑱}}); unital but incoherent gives \text{{\igfont 𐑞}}; fully coherent quantum
401	\text{{\igfont 𐑐}}.
